EmailTemplate.textOnly:
The MaritzCX platform failed to register the MaritzCX for Salesforce package upgrade. Please follow these instructions to complete the upgrade process:

1. Log into your Admin account at MaritzCX.
2. Go to ADMIN | Company Setup | Salesforce Integration.
3. Under Salesforce Settings, click on the Refresh Package Version button.

The new features will now be available.

Additional Details
